OL,3,GNEWSAGiant confirmed as star guest for
OL,4,Alight switch-ons
OL,5,
OL,6,FFormer Gladiator Giant has been
OL,7,Fconfirmed as the star guest at two
OL,8,FChristmas light switch-ons in
OL,9,FDerbyshire later this month.
OL,11,FJamie Bigg will turn on the lights in
OL,12,FLong Eaton on 26 November, before doing
OL,13,Fthe same in his hometown of Ilkeston
OL,14,Fthe following day.
OL,16,FThe 41-year-old first appeared on BBC's
OL,17,FGladiators when it returned in 2024,
OL,18,Fbut in April announced on social media
OL,19,Fhe would not be renewed for series four
OL,20,Fof the show.
OL,23,APub: 18-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (E) NewsCReg TVFWeather
